<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Piper Jaffray cuts Redhook.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Piper Jaffray cuts Redhook.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Piper Jaffray said Friday it downgraded Redhook Ale Brewery Inc to market performer from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Piper also cut its 1996 earnings estimates to $0.34 from $0.44 a share and its 1997 estimates to $0.40 from $0.65 a share.</p>
<p>--- Piper said the microbrew market is highly competitive and sales of craft beer are leveling off.</p>
<p>-- Piper said it expects Redhook's fourth quarter sales to be about 15 percent lower than earlier projections.</p>
<p>-- Redhook share price dropped 4-1/2 to 9-1/2.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
